Description: native desktop coding agent built with Qt6
 LyCode is a native desktop coding agent written in C++20 with Qt6.
 .
 It provides workspace and session management, streaming conversations
 with incremental Markdown rendering, declarative tool calling behind a
 permission gate, sub-agents, background tasks, MCP servers over stdio,
 skills, syntax highlighting and a local SQLite session store.
 .
 The agent runtime is pure C++ and does not depend on Node.js.
